I found the solution! At least for my case! In the bootstrap.css file, the lines:

.modal-backdrop {
  position: fixed;
  top: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  left: 0;
  z-index: 1040;
  background-color: #000000;
}

Changes to:

.modal-backdrop {
  position: fixed;
  top: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  left: 0;
  -z-index: 1040;
  background-color: #000000;
}

The problem is in the z-index. Disable this line works like a charm!

